{"story_id":"BOOK-GATSBY-01","duration_seconds":69.04050000000001,"timeline":[{"sentence_id":"BOOK-GATSBY-01-S001","language":"lt","start":0.0,"end":5.955958333333333,"text":"Kai buvau jaunesnis ir lengviau pažeidžiamas, tėvas davė man vieną patarimą."},{"sentence_id":"BOOK-GATSBY-01-S001","language":"en","start":6.255958333333333,"end":13.291083333333333,"text":"When I was younger and more vulnerable, my father gave me some advice."},{"sentence_id":"BOOK-GATSBY-01-S002","language":"lt","start":13.824416666666666,"end":16.30108333333333,"text":"Nuo tada vis jį apmąstau."},{"sentence_id":"BOOK-GATSBY-01-S002","language":"en","start":16.60108333333333,"end":21.003,"text":"I've been turning it over in my mind ever since."},{"sentence_id":"BOOK-GATSBY-01-S003","language":"lt","start":21.53633333333333,"end":31.812749999999998,"text":"„Kai tik užsimanysi ką nors kritikuoti, – pasakė jis man, – atsimink, kad ne visi šiame pasaulyje turėjo tokių privalumų, kokių turėjai tu.“"},{"sentence_id":"BOOK-GATSBY-01-S003","language":"en","start":32.11275,"end":43.831916666666665,"text":"“Whenever you feel like criticizing anyone,” he told me, “just remember that not everyone in this world has had the advantages that you've had.”"},{"sentence_id":"BOOK-GATSBY-01-S004","language":"lt","start":44.365249999999996,"end":46.63529166666666,"text":"Daugiau jis nieko nepasakė."},{"sentence_id":"BOOK-GATSBY-01-S004","language":"en","start":46.935291666666664,"end":49.47566666666666,"text":"He didn't say any more."},{"sentence_id":"BOOK-GATSBY-01-S005","language":"lt","start":50.009,"end":53.924791666666664,"text":"Bet mudu visada gerai supratome vienas kitą be daug žodžių."},{"sentence_id":"BOOK-GATSBY-01-S005","language":"en","start":54.22479166666667,"end":60.19520833333333,"text":"But the two of us have always understood each other well without saying much."},{"sentence_id":"BOOK-GATSBY-01-S006","language":"lt","start":60.72854166666667,"end":64.326375,"text":"Supratau, kad jis turėjo omenyje kur kas daugiau."},{"sentence_id":"BOOK-GATSBY-01-S006","language":"en","start":64.62637500000001,"end":69.04050000000001,"text":"I understood that he meant a great deal more than that."}],"audio_sha256":{"bilingual":"9cd3e78529ac63e26ff351596160de26f5218362ded785f77e910bbd09e1568b","english":"7a480fca907b128256952f98838b373b7c993586e8ab6cddf89de09e0383648d"},"rate_switches":{"version":1,"audio_sha256":"9cd3e78529ac63e26ff351596160de26f5218362ded785f77e910bbd09e1568b","speech":[[0.21,5.67],[6.555,12.916],[14.034,15.975],[16.891,20.672],[21.556,31.627],[32.542,43.623],[44.545,46.416],[47.025,49.456],[50.089,53.799],[54.264,59.925],[60.998,64.059],[64.836,68.727]],"sw":[0,6.112,13.475,16.433,21.114,32.084,44.084,46.721,49.773,54.032,60.462,64.447]}}
